        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Yevitha asilan’ya Isilaeli myaka thanthatũ. Na ĩndĩ Yevitha Mũngileati akw’a, na athikwa ndũani ĩmwe ya ku Ngileati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina wake Ivisani wa Mbethi‐leemu atw’ĩka mũsilan’ya wa Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aĩ na ana mĩongo ĩtatũ; nake anengane eĩtu make mĩongo ĩtatũ kũngĩ, na atwaĩa ana make eĩtu mĩongo ĩtatũ kuma kũngĩ. Na asilan’ya Isilaeli myaka mũonza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Ivisani akw’a, na athikwa Mbethi‐leemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ĩtina wake Eloni Mũnzevuluni atw’ĩka mũsilan’ya wa Isilaeli; na asilan’ya Isilaeli myaka ĩkũmi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Eloni Mũnzevuluni akw’a, na athikwa Aiyaloni nthĩ ya Nzevuluni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
